# Client Java

- Shared constants in `com.mystaria.phantasmon`; client setup in `com.mystaria.phantasmon.client`.
- Ghost render/spawn is local and driven by backend WebSocket events.
- Business logic without Minecraft: JUnit. Rendering: manual QA.
- `GET /version` before auth. JWT in memory. Translate `ERROR_*` codes.
